// Pull request: #6500 new: Contagious Interview (DPRK) EtherHiding Chain - Emerging Threat And Hunting Rules
// Pull request URL: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/pull/6500
// Pull request author: popkir
// Change: new rule
// Title: Contagious Interview Loader Artefacts Created In User .vs_cache Folder - Windows
// Sigma ID: d6953403-deb1-4849-882f-5456813dde8d
// Status: experimental | Level: high
// Author: Kirill Popov
// Date: 2026-10-21 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: execution, T1059.007, T1059.005, command-and-control, T1105
// Tags: detection.emerging-threats
// Description: Detects creation of the loader and implant working files that a DPRK "Contagious Interview"
//   dropper chain writes into a ".vs_cache" folder in the user profile. The stage-1 dropper writes
//   main.js (the EtherHiding loader), package.json, source and main.vbs there and relaunches through
//   "wscript.exe //B main.vbs"; the stage-3 implant later writes key-agent.js, vs.sid, mmc.pid and
//   log.log, and the MMC wallet backdoor writes mmc.log, into the same folder.
// False positives:
//   - Unlikely
// References:
//   - https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/dprk-adopts-etherhiding
//   - https://www.ic3.gov/CSA/2026/260918.pdf
//   - https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/677b85d56283a7c22f7f32350c6d81a7873c6c6afe1ff6b0d5a9608ba9614068
//   - https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/761e0adb34e6f89ba43fcd65cf861593bfee9319e38e6175394921309e83a254
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/fa23002b3c18ef5eb6ee47ceedde81228ebef016/rules-emerging-threats/2026/TA/Contagious-Interview/file_event_win_mal_contagious_interview_vs_cache_artefacts.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language, Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceFileEvents
| where FolderPath contains "\\.vs_cache\\" and (FolderPath endswith "\\main.js" or FolderPath endswith "\\main.vbs" or FolderPath endswith "\\key-agent.js" or FolderPath endswith "\\vs.sid" or FolderPath endswith "\\mmc.pid" or FolderPath endswith "\\mmc.log" or FolderPath endswith "\\log.log")
